  Entitlements of the macOS app (bundle.macOS.entitlements). The microphone one is required once the app is signed with the hardened runtime
  (Developer ID, notarization); an ad-hoc build does not need it but carries it so that the later signature does not change what the app may do.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>com.apple.security.device.audio-input</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
